.TH ckman-fido-access-force-change 1  ckman 
.SH NAME
ckman\-fido\-access\-force\-change \- Force the user to change the PIN on next use
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBckman\-fido\-access\-force\-change\fR [\fB\-P\fR|\fB\-\-pin\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Force the user to change the PIN on next use
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-P\fR, \fB\-\-pin\fR \fI<PIN>\fR
Current PIN (prompted when omitted)
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
